# Secondary School Genetics Instruction: Making Problem Solving Explicit and Meaningful.

**Authors:** Thomson, Norman, Stewart, James

## Abstract
Explains an algorithm which details procedures for solving a broad class of genetics problems common to pre-college biology. Several flow charts (developed from the algorithm) are given with sample questions and suggestions for student use. Conclusions are based on the authors' research (which includes student interviews and textbook analyses). (DH)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ322632

